WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:10.340
Honestly, I always like listening to a song that sometimes makes me cry because it has a really beautiful message.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.680
We are the world. We are the children.

00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:21.580
We are the world. We are the children. We are the hope.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:39.140
And I think we should come together more and more each day as a community, as a race, as people,

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:48.700
no matter the color, the height, the age, it doesn't matter where you're from or where you come from,

00:00:49.380 --> 00:01:06.680
what matters is that you can contribute something beautiful to this gorgeous planet, so that not only we enjoy it, but also those who come after us.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.040
It can be.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:09.640
Much love.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:11.780
Lots, lots, lots

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:12.440
of beautiful energy.

00:01:14.399 --> 00:01:15.740
And a lot of

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.000
personal work for everyone.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.100
So that we can be happy.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:21.500
And thank you very much.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.060
Thank you, man.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.620
Thank you to you, my friend.

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:26.600
Thank you.
